<template><div><PageHeader title="消息中心" description="审批待办、审批结果和工资条发布通知"><el-button :disabled="!unread" @click="readAll">全部已读</el-button><el-button type="primary" :icon="Refresh" @click="load">刷新</el-button></PageHeader><section class="panel message-list" v-loading="loading"><div v-for="item in rows" :key="item.id" class="message-row" :class="{unread:!item.read_at}" @click="markRead(item)"><div><strong>{{item.title}}</strong><p>{{item.content}}</p><span>{{item.created_at}}</span></div><el-tag v-if="!item.read_at" size="small">未读</el-tag></div><el-empty v-if="!loading&&!rows.length" description="暂无消息"/></section></div></template>
<script setup>
import{onMounted,ref}from'vue';import{ElMessage}from'element-plus';import{Refresh}from'@element-plus/icons-vue';import PageHeader from'../components/PageHeader.vue';import{messageApi}from'../api';import{useAppStore}from'../stores/app';const app=useAppStore(),rows=ref([]),unread=ref(0),loading=ref(false);async function load(){loading.value=true;try{const r=await messageApi.list();rows.value=r.data.items;unread.value=r.data.unread_count;app.unreadMessages=unread.value}catch(e){ElMessage.error(e.businessMessage)}finally{loading.value=false}}async function markRead(item){if(item.read_at)return;await messageApi.read(item.id);await load()}async function readAll(){await messageApi.readAll();ElMessage.success('已全部标记为已读');await load()}onMounted(load)
</script>
